  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The LC045 code fix no longer emits code that does not compile for LINQ query syntax. It wrapped the lowered identity projection, producing select o.Include(...) where the range variable is an entity rather than a queryable (CS0411); every query-syntax diagnostic was affected since 5.7.28. The fix now goes on the expression the query draws from: from o in db.Orders becomes from o in db.Orders.Include(x => x.Customer), and an existing chain is extended in place.",
